## 7. Logging Example

```python
from medorbits.logging_config import (
    configure_logging,
    get_logger,
    log_context,
)

configure_logging()

logger = get_logger("medorbits.app")

with log_context(
    request_id="req-example-001",
    correlation_id="corr-example-001",
):
    logger.info(
        "Application processed",
        extra={
            "application_id": "APP-1001",
            "status": "received",
        },
    )
```

Select the logging format through environment configuration:

```dotenv
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
LOG_FORMAT=json
```

Use `LOG_FORMAT=text` for readable console output when appropriate.

