## 8. Validation Example

```python
from medorbits.validators import (
    ValidationError,
    validate_application_payload,
)

payload = {
    "full_name": "Aarav Sharma",
    "email": "aarav@example.com",
    "course": "MBBS",
    "consent": True,
}

try:
    validated = validate_application_payload(payload)
except ValidationError as exc:
    error_response = {
        "success": False,
        "error": exc.to_dict(),
    }
else:
    # Pass validated data to the authorized service layer.
    print(validated)
```

The application service must still enforce business rules, user permissions, eligibility requirements, and database constraints.

